# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout, so the
# bytes we commit are the bytes the Docker image and the SFTP deploy see.
# `tactic.py` is currently CRLF in this working tree (core.autocrlf=true); the
# next `git add`/checkout re-normalises it to LF — see README/OPTIMIZATION_REVIEW
# #15 about the deploy byte mismatch.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.webp binary

# npm's lock file must stay byte-identical to what npm wrote.
package-lock.json -text
